  "solution": {
    "text": "Stopping potential<br >        <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></math> <br >Hence  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>  v/s  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math>  curve will be hyperbola and  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  curve will be straight line with slope positive hence (A, C)",
    "image": null
